<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Consolidated Paper said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Consolidated Paper said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter cut its rating of Consolidated Paper Inc to a neutral rating, according to a source.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at $51 on Friday.  </p>
<p>-- The stock had previously been rated an accumulate.</p>
</text>
